Integrates the modern Cloudflare Tunnel daemon (cloudflared) into OPNsense,
allowing self-hosted services to be exposed through Cloudflare Zero Trust
without requiring inbound firewall rules or a public IP address.

Features:
o Live tunnel connectivity status and Edge connection tracking
o Configurable Prometheus metrics exporter
o RFC 5424 and Zerolog logging with automatic syslog-ng rotation
o Modern daemon support (cloudflared 2026.11.1+)
o Continuously maintained and updated by Valuor

WWW: https://github.com/wandersonmaracaipe/os-cloudflared-v2

